  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "官方声明与早会  (Morning Statement and Emergency Meeting)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At dawn, Li Mingji's lawyer drops the police report and Bu Xiaogu is allowed to leave, while Xingzi and Kaiwen brief Chun Yuqiao just as network executives from DTS arrive. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "李铭基的律师已经向警方撤回报案了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "今天早上他们的官方微博也发了声明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "声明说昨天晚上是个意外。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是话里还是暗指星天没有照顾好他们的艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在这么短的时间里，我们只能争取到这样了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "卫视的人来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "叫咱们现在马上跟他们进会议室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这么早，早餐店都没开门呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "估计昨天晚上一出事，他们就连夜开会了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "商量出个主意，一早上问罪来了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "李铭基的律师已经向警方撤回报案了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Li Mingji's lawyer has already withdrawn the report with the police.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "今天早上他们的官方微博也发了声明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This morning their official Weibo account also posted a statement.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "声明说昨天晚上是个意外。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The statement says last night was an accident.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是话里还是暗指星天没有照顾好他们的艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet between the lines it still hints Xingtian failed to look after their artist.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在这么短的时间里，我们只能争取到这样了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In such a short time, this is the most we could secure.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "卫视的人来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The people from the network have arrived.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "叫咱们现在马上跟他们进会议室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They want us to join them in the conference room right away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这么早，早餐店都没开门呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is so early that breakfast shops have not even opened yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "估计昨天晚上一出事，他们就连夜开会了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The moment trouble broke out last night, they must have met overnight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "商量出个主意，一早上问罪来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They worked out a plan and came first thing this morning to demand answers.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "李铭基的律师已经向警方撤回报案了。",
